OL,3,GNEWSAMurder investigation launched into
OL,4,Adeaths of four people in house fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FA murder investigation has been
OL,7,Flaunched following the deaths of four
OL,8,Fpeople after a house fire in County
OL,9,FWaterford, Gardai (Irish police) have
OL,10,Fsaid.
OL,12,FTwo children and two adults - a man and
OL,13,Fa woman - died following the blaze on
OL,14,FBirch Avenue, on the outskirts of
OL,15,FWaterford city, shortly after 05:00
OL,16,Flocal time on Tuesday.
OL,18,FTwo other children have been critically
OL,19,Finjured and they are being treated in
OL,20,Fhospital.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
