OL,3,GNEWSAMurder investigation launched into
OL,4,Adeaths of four people in house fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FGardai said they were investigating the
OL,7,Ffire as arson and appealed to anyone
OL,8,Fwho was in the vicinity in the early
OL,9,Fhours of Tuesday to contact them.
